# =============================================================================
# .dockerignore — Excalidraw Docker build context filter
# =============================================================================
#
# Strategy: deny-all + explicit allowlist.
#   The leading `*` excludes everything. Subsequent `!` rules re-include
#   exactly what the Dockerfile needs for `yarn install` and `yarn build:app:docker`.
#
# What IS needed:
#   - package.json + yarn.lock + .npmrc      (dependency installation)
#   - tsconfig.json                           (TypeScript compilation)
#   - .eslintrc.json                          (ESLint during build check)
#   - excalidraw-app/                         (the deployable SPA source)
#   - packages/                               (internal workspace packages)
#   - scripts/                                (build utilities: build-version.js etc.)
#   - public/                                 (static assets: fonts, icons)
#   - .env.production                         (build-time env vars for Vite)
#   - nginx.conf                              (copied into final image)
#   - docker-entrypoint.sh                    (copied into final image)
#
# What is NOT needed (excluded):
#   - node_modules/                           (installed fresh inside Docker)
#   - dist/, build/                           (previous build artifacts)
#   - dev-docs/, examples/                    (documentation, demos)
#   - .github/, .codesandbox/, .husky/        (CI/dev tooling)
#   - excalidraw-app/tests/                   (test files not needed in image)
#   - packages/*/node_modules                 (installed fresh inside Docker)
#   - packages/*/dist                         (not needed; built from source)
#   - .git/                                   (git history not needed in image)
#   - *.md                                    (documentation)
# =============================================================================

# ── Deny everything by default ───────────────────────────────────────────────
*

# ── Re-include: dependency manifests and config ───────────────────────────────
!package.json
!yarn.lock
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.json
!.eslintrc.json

# ── Re-include: environment (production only) ─────────────────────────────────
# .env.development and .env.test are intentionally NOT included.
# build:app:docker uses production env vars baked at build time.
!.env.production

# ── Re-include: production infrastructure files ───────────────────────────────
!nginx.conf
!docker-entrypoint.sh

# ── Re-include: application source ───────────────────────────────────────────
!excalidraw-app/
!packages/
!scripts/
!public/

# ── Exclude: build artifacts and installed modules ────────────────────────────
# These are explicitly excluded even though they are inside re-included dirs.
# Pattern: directory/** excludes all contents recursively.
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/dev-dist

# ── Exclude: test files (not needed inside Docker image) ──────────────────────
excalidraw-app/tests/

# ── Exclude: documentation and dev tooling (inside re-included dirs) ─────────
**/*.md
**/CHANGELOG*

# ── Exclude: deployment scripts (not needed in the application image) ─────────
deploy/

